        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Baldwin SEA-CQE, Seattle Handleset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nWe love the strong, sharp silhouette of the Seattle Handleset. It is a modern piece for front doors of even the most contemporary homes. The Seattle Entryset with Square Escutcheon is available in Satin Nickel, Polished Chrome, and Venetian Bronze finishes as well as others. Choose from 3 modern interior trim options like the Tube Lever that is pictured. As part of Baldwin's Reserve Collection, the Seattle Entryset has a lifetime mechanical warranty and a 25 year finish warranty. Choose from single cylinder and dummy functions. This handleset comes with an adjustable latch that will fit 2-3/4 inch backsets and 2-3/8 inch backsets. It will fit 1-3/4 inch up to 2-1/2 inch thick doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Seattle Handleset with Contemporary Square Escutcheon:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fits 2-1/8\" cross bore for both deadbolt and grip with a 1\" edge bore for both grip latch and deadbolt latch.</li>\r\n<li>Baldwin C-Keyway.</li>\r\n<li>Latch: square corner adjustable</li>\r\n<li>Strike: square corner</li>\r\n<li>Brass deadbolt features 1\" throw. Grip offers 1/2\" passage/privacy function bolt.</li>\r\n<li>Warranty: 25 year finish warranty and a limited lifetime mechanical warranty.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Baldwin Reserve Modern Seattle Entrance Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Exterior Overall Length: 17-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Top Plate Width: 2-11/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Top Plate Length: 9-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Projection: 2-7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Distance between Latch Bore to Bottom Mounting Hole: 8-13/32\" c.c.</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\" - 2\" standard with optional thick door kit for 2\" - 2-1/2\".</li>\r\n<li>Backset: Adjustable for 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Seattle Handleset with Contemporary Square Escutcheon",
                "description": "We love the strong, sharp silhouette of the Seattle Handleset. It is a modern piece for front doors of even the most contemporary homes. The Seattle Entryset with Square Escutcheon is available in Satin Nickel, Polished Chrome, and Venetian Bronze finishes as well as others. Choose from 3 modern interior trim options like the Tube Lever that is pictured. As part of Baldwin's Reserve Collection, the Seattle Entryset has a lifetime mechanical warranty and a 25 year finish warranty. Choose from single cylinder and dummy functions. This handleset comes with an adjustable latch that will fit 2-3/4 inch backsets and 2-3/8 inch backsets. It will fit 1-3/4 inch up to 2-1/2 inch thick doors.",
